  "caption": "\\textbf{Action-conditioned visual forecasting from a fixed observed reference.} Recorded inputs: the prespecified median DROID case and the first internal-training trajectory/frame of each IWS task, selected without outcomes. IWS training is in progress; these examples imply neither measured gains nor simultaneous inputs. Autoregression feeds forecasts forward; ShiftWM mixes a fixed observed feature grid plus bounded corrections. Both use the same history and supplied actions, omitted from these conceptual routes. Camera and feature glyphs are schematic, never predicted RGB; three drawn steps illustrate the dependency through the ten-step endpoint. Bottom: all 141 DROID development episodes, with lower-error circles and higher-error crosses against matched autoregression, averaging windows and three seeds. The 5.30\\% reduction compares population mean native, training-standardized endpoint errors. Uncertainty: Figure~\\ref{fig:editorial-spatial}. Images: DROID (CC BY 4.0) and IWS \\citep{zhang2026rlawm}.",
